cross-possession memory (lag-1 effect >= lag-2; not just score margin or team quality).", "observed_result": "FAIL decay-sanity: DRIVE lifts +0.015,+0.020,+0.018,+0.021,+0.020 (flat). Within-team: DRIVE lag-1 +0.015 to -0.002. Cohen d ~0.01-0.03; p~0 from n>150k. Callable play-type horizons = 0.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Flat non-decaying lifts collapse under within-team baseline; team-quality confound.", "observed_sample_and_power": "n>150k per lag; 915,570 possessions", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "failed_gate"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:confounding"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:CONFOUNDING"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPS-073"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-054", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-054: PUTBACK suppression mechanism: fatigue vs value", "score": 0.845, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPA-050 auto_related_family (record_link_extends) FAM:SF-APPA-054", "request matches RQC:RQC-006 (0.74); FAM:SF-APPA-054 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-006"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "PUTBACK suppression mechanism: fatigue vs value", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "PUTBACK suppresses the next star possession via fatigue (stronger in H2 and Q4), while PUTBACK itself remains high-value.", "observed_result": "H1 delta -0.038 vs H2 -0.130 (22 stars, 3.4x). Q1 -0.009 vs Q4 -0.289 (11 stars; Q4 pooled n=34). PUTBACK H2 1.528 vs 1.217 (+0.311) n=8,614 vs 474,564. After opp PUTBACK offense 1.097 vs 1.210 (d=-0.113) n=15,898.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Q4 PUTBACK is sparse (34 pooled poss at n>=30; Mitchell n=34 drives the Q4 cell) even though the H2 vs H1 and aftershock tests are larger.", "observed_verdict": "supported"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:insufficient_exposure"}, {"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:EXPOSURE_SPARSITY"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-050"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-055", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-055: All play types x Q1-Q4 gradient on 30 stars", "score": 0.845, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPA-050 auto_related_family (record_link_extends) FAM:SF-APPA-055", "request matches RQC:RQC-006 (0.74); FAM:SF-APPA-055 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-006"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "All play types x Q1-Q4 gradient on 30 stars", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "Only PUTBACK shows a fatigue signature (near-zero Q1 suppression compounding to Q4) across the full 30-star panel.", "observed_result": "PUTBACK Q1 d=-0.001 to Q4 d=-0.233, Q1->Q4 -0.232 (Q1 poss 722 / Q4 531). Other PTs suppress in Q1 already; largest other gradient DRIVE -0.060. CUT reverses +0.020. TRANSITION -0.053.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "On the full 30-star weighted panel, only PUTBACK is near-zero in Q1 and heavy in Q4.", "observed_sample_and_power": "30 stars; PUTBACK Q4 n=531 poss", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "supported"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-050"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-054"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-056"}]}], "n_results": 10}

